---
// Portable Text `em` mark.
//
// MAPPED SO IT CANNOT VANISH SILENTLY. astro-portabletext falls an unmapped
// mark through to its children — the words survive, the emphasis does not, and
// nothing warns. 97 of the 167 imported posts carry emphasis, so leaving this
// unmapped would have quietly flattened italics across more than half the blog
// with a green build. Same reasoning as ProseStrong.
---

<em class="prose__em"><slot /></em>
